From: as7760 bring-up
Subject: [PATCH] powerpc: dts: t2080rdb: make i2c0 available before relocation

dram_init() runs before relocation and reads the DIMM SPD over I2C bus 0, on
RAMBOOT_PBL builds too (fsl_ddr_sdram_size()). Without bootph on i2c0 this
fails with "__get_spd: Cannot find udev for a bus 0".

--- a/arch/powerpc/dts/t2080rdb-u-boot.dtsi	2026-11-14 13:06:15.675493434 -0800
+++ b/arch/powerpc/dts/t2080rdb-u-boot.dtsi	2026-11-14 13:06:15.743493704 -0800
@@ -9,4 +9,9 @@
 	bootph-all;
 };
 
+/* dram_init() reads the DIMM SPD before relocation (also on RAMBOOT_PBL). */
+&i2c0 {
+	bootph-all;
+};
+
 #include "u-boot.dtsi"
